			"notes": "### 更新日志\n- 新增：导热管方块；六面联网的热力网络（共享总热量）；纯被动式更新（不注册任何 Tick）。\n- 新增：与 Create 锅炉 / 流体储罐集成——任意导热管正上方的器械可读取整张网络的总热量。\n- 新增：模组专属创造模式标签页；合成配方兼容 JEI。\n- 修复：移除所有热源后，热力网络热量不再残留（锅炉会正确冷却归零）。\n-----\n- Initial release: the Heat Pipe block; face-connected heat networks (shared total heat); fully passive, no-tick updates.\n- Added: Create boiler / fluid tank integration — devices above any pipe receive the network's total heat.\n- Added: dedicated creative tab; crafting recipe visible in JEI.\n- Fixed: the heat network no longer retains heat after all sources are removed (boilers cool down correctly)."
